  "metadata": {"name": "rrtm_kdist_band08", "description": "RRTM longwave band 8, 1080-1180 cm^-1 (low H2O; high O3): g-point-reduced absorption-coefficient and Planck-fraction tables of WRF's module_ra_rrtm.F (WRF 4.8), transcribed by script from the RRTM_DATA binary (run/RRTM_DATA, big-endian real32) and the module's DATA statements after the 256-to-140 g-point reduction of rrtm_lookuptable/CMBGB8 (weights RWGT = WT(ig)/sum of WT over the combined points). Values are the binary32 numbers the module holds, printed with the shortest round-tripping decimal. Used by rrtm_gas_optics.esm."},
